-- Section (4): 4-Valent Spin-1/2 Quantum Tetrahedron Entanglement Across Bipartition (1,2) | (3,4).
-- Intertwiner basis in C^4 x C^4 = {|00>, |01>, |10>, |11>}^2 (exact integer matrices, zero sqrt(2)!):
--   |k=0>: Psi0 = [0,1,-1,0]^T [0,1,-1,0]  (singlet x singlet)
--   |k=1>: Psi1 = 2|00,11> - (|01>+|10>)(|01>+|10>) + 2|11,00>  (triplet-coupled singlet)
--   Maximal superposition |k=0> + |k=1>: Psi0 + Psi1 (exact integer entries in {0, -2, +2}!).
qent-r4 : BZ → BZ → BZ → BZ → List BZ
qent-r4 a b c d = cons a (cons b (cons c (cons d nil)))
